l duration-500 ease-in-out px-5 py-6 border-b-2 border-[#F6F8FA]" data-v-c4c0bff8><div class="flex justify-between items-center cursor-pointer" data-v-c4c0bff8><h4 class="text-xl font-[500]" data-v-c4c0bff8>How do I get paid?</h4><svg width="14" height="2" viewBox="0 0 14 2" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="transition-transform duration-500 ease-in-out" data-v-c4c0bff8><path d="M14 0H0V2H14V0Z" fill="black"></path></svg></div><div class="h-auto mt-3 transition-all duration-500 ease-in-out" data-v-c4c0bff8><p class="font-normal font-inter text-[#475467] text-sm pr-10" data-v-c4c0bff8>Referral rewards are paid directly once referrals are verified.</p></div></div></div><div class="defaut-animate" style="animation-delay:0.1s;animation-duration:0.5s;" data-v-31a73d37><div class="transition-all duration-500 ease-in-out px-5 py-6 border-b-2 border-[#F6F8FA]" data-v-c4c0bff8><div class="flex justify-between items-center cursor-pointer" data-v-c4c0bff8><h4 class="text-xl font-[500]" data-v-c4c0bff8>Do I need to be a student?</h4><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 14 14" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-4 flex-shrink-0 h-4 transition-transform duration-500 ease-in-out" data-v-c4c0bff8><path d="M6 6V0H8V6H14V8H8V14H6V8H0V6H6Z" fill="black"></path></svg></div><div class="max-h-0 overflow-hidden transition-all duration-500 ease-in-out" data-v-c4c0bff8><p class="font-normal font-inter text-[#475467] text-sm pr-10" data-v-c4c0bff8>No, you don't need to be a student. While the program is popular among students, we welcome anyone passionate about fintech, community building, and growth. Whether you're a recent graduate, NYSC member, content creator, or just someone who loves sharing innovative solutions, you can join and benefit from the program.</p></div></div></div><div class="defaut-animate" style="animation-delay:0.2s;animation-duration:0.5s;" data-v-31a73d37><div class="transition-all duration-500 ease-in-out px-5 py-6 border-b-2 border-[#F6F8FA]" data-v-c4c0bff8><div class="flex justify-between items-center cursor-pointer" data-v-c4c0bff8><h4 class="text-xl font-[500]" data-v-c4c0bff8>Do I need to pay to join?</h4><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 14 14" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-4 flex-shrink-0 h-4 transition-transform duration-500 ease-in-out" data-v-c4c0bff8><path d="M6 6V0H8V6H14V8H8V14H6V8H0V6H6Z" fill="black"></path></svg></div><div class="max-h-0 overflow-hidden transition-all duration-500 ease-in-out" data-v-c4c0bff8><p class="font-normal font-inter text-[#475467] text-sm pr-10" data-v-c4c0bff8>No, joining the GuildPay Ambassador Program is completely free. There are no registration fees, membership costs, or hidden charges. You simply sign up, get verified, and start earning rewards for your referrals.</p></div></div></div><div class="defaut-animate" style="animation-delay:0.3s;animation-duration:0.5s;" data-v-31a73d37><div class="transition-all duration-500 ease-in-out px-5 py-6 border-b-2 border-[#F6F8FA]" data-v-c4c0bff8><div class="flex justify-between items-center cursor-pointer" data-v-c4c0bff8><h4 class="text-xl font-[500]" data-v-c4c0bff8>Can I join while in school or during NYSC?</h4><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 14 14" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-4 flex-shrink-0 h-4 transition-transform duration-500 ease-in-out" data-v-c4c0bff8><path d="M6 6V0H8V6H14V8H8V14H6V8H0V6H6Z" fill="black"></path></svg></div><div class="max-h-0 overflow-hidden transition-all duration-500 ease-in-out" data-v-c4c0bff8><p class="font-normal font-inter text-[#475467] text-sm pr-10" data-v-c4c0bff8>Absolutely! The program is designed to be flexible and fits perfectly into your schedule whether you're a student, on NYSC duty, or managing other commitments. You can work at your own pace and balance it with your studies or service year.</p></div></div></div><div class="defaut-animate" style="animation-delay:0.4s;animation-duration:0.5s;" data-v-31a73d37><div class="transition-all duration-500 ease-in-out px-5 py-6 border-b-2 border-[#F6F8FA]" data-v-c4c0bff8><div class="flex justify-between items-center cursor-pointer" data-v-c4c0bff8><h4 class="text-xl font-[500]" data-v-c4c0bff8>Is there a limit to how much I can earn?</h4><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 14 14" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-4 flex-shrink-0 h-4 transition-transform duration-500 ease-in-out" data-v-c4c0bff8><path d="M6 6V0H8V6H14V8H8V14H6V8H0V6H6Z" fill="black"></path></svg></div><div class="max-h-0 overflow-hidden transition-all duration-500 ease-in-out" data-v-c4c0bff8><p class="font-normal font-inter text-[#475467] text-sm pr-10" data-v-c4c0bff8>No, there's no cap on your earnings. The more successful referrals you make, the more you earn. As you level up through our gamified system, your earning potential increases with higher referral rewards, exclusive bonuses, and leadership opportunities.</p></div></div></div><div class="defaut-animate" style="animation-delay:0.5s;animation-duration:0.5s;" data-v-31a73d37><div class="transition-all duration-500 ease-in-out px-5 py-6 border-b-2 border-[#F6F8FA]" data-v-c4c0bff8><div class="flex justify-between items-center cursor-pointer" data-v-c4c0bff8><h4 class="text-xl font-[500]" data-v-c4c0bff8>Can I grow into a bigger role?</h4><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 14 14" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-4 flex-shrink-0 h-4 transition-transform duration-500 ease-in-out" data-v-c4c0bff8><path d="M6 6V0H8V6H14V8H8V14H6V8H0V6H6Z" fill="black"></path></svg></div><div class="max-h-0 overflow-hidden transition-all duration-500 ease-in-out" data-v-c4c0bff8><p class="font-normal font-inter text-[#475467] text-sm pr-10" data-v-c4c0bff8>Yes! The GuildPay Ambassador Program has a clear progression path. As you level up from Rookie to Legend, you unlock leadership opportunities, including the chance to lead other ambassadors, represent GuildPay at events, access internships, and even secure paid roles within GuildPay or partner organizations.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="relative bg-[#0A0D14] px-6 py-20 lg:py-32 overflow-hidden" data-v-83682ced data-v-2aaddaa0><div class="mx-auto relative z-10" data-v-2aaddaa0><div class="absolute top-[100px] left-[100px] md:block hidden" data-v-2aaddaa0><img src="/images/ambassadors/who-should-join/students.png" alt="Ambassador" class="md:w-[127px] md:h-[127px] w-[70px] h-[70px] rounded-2xl object-cover shadow-lg" data-v-2aaddaa0></div><div class="absolute top-[-100px] md:top-[-80px] right-0 md:right-[100px] hidden md:block" data-v-2aaddaa0><img src="/images/ambassadors/who-should-join/influencers.png" alt="Ambassador" class="md:w-[127px] md:h-[127px] w-[70px] h-[70px] rounded-2xl object-cover shadow-lg" data-v-2aaddaa0></div><div class="flex items-center justify-center mb-2" data-v-2aaddaa0><img src="/images/ambassadors/cta-avatar-1.png" alt="Ambassador" class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full object-cover shadow-lg border-2 border-white" style="background-color:#AA9C75;" data-v-2aaddaa0><img src="/images/ambassadors/cta-avatar-2.png" alt="Ambassador" class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full object-cover shadow-lg border-2 border-white -ml-3" style="background-color:#D4B2AF;" data-v-2aaddaa0><img src="/images/ambassadors/cta-avatar-3.png" alt="Ambassador" class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full object-cover shadow-lg border-2 border-white -ml-3" style="background-color:#C3C7DF;" data-v-2aaddaa0></div><div class="text-center relative z-10" data-v-2aaddaa0><h2 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-medium mb-6 grad-text bg-clip-text text-transparent tracking-[-1%]" data-v-2aaddaa0> Ready to Make an Impact? </h2><p class="text-[#9CA3AF] text-base md:text-lg mb-12 max-w-2xl mx-auto" data-v-2aaddaa0> Join hundreds of ambassadors worldwide<br class="hidden md:block" data-v-2aaddaa0> and start your journey today. </p><div class="bg-[#071D49] inline-block round